{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 0.0, "end": 5.64, "text": "一定要枪毙这个亡者荣耀的策划"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 5.64, "end": 7.48, "text": "亡者荣耀的领导"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 7.48, "end": 12.48, "text": "你这个亡者荣耀肯定是一个烦恼的游戏"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 12.48, "end": 16.6, "text": "我上次说完你的坏话呀"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 16.6, "end": 19.8, "text": "你就要开始对我施施迫害"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 19.8, "end": 22.26, "text": "我和你战斗"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 22.26, "end": 24.36, "text": "你战斗不过我"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 86.42, "end": 88.44, "text": "王者荣耀"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 88.44, "end": 91.0, "text": "你对我实施了"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 91.0, "end": 92.28, "text": "这么多次迫害"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 92.28, "end": 94.98, "text": "你看看这个时日期"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 94.98, "end": 96.74, "text": "你从"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 96.74, "end": 97.74, "text": "这个"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 97.74, "end": 102.46, "text": "2月27日"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 102.46, "end": 103.76, "text": "就对我实施迫害"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 103.76, "end": 106.34, "text": "你就让我去犯刑"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 106.34, "end": 107.74, "text": "你看这一局"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 107.74, "end": 109.04, "text": "我尽力来打"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 109.04, "end": 109.92, "text": "他让我去犯刑"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 148.84, "end": 151.96, "text": "我都已经这样了 他还要迫害我"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 151.96, "end": 157.26, "text": "你这个王者荣耀 你不把你的领导枪毙了"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 157.26, "end": 159.62, "text": "你王者荣耀 你不能信我"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 159.62, "end": 162.5, "text": "你王者荣耀的收入 你不能增长"}
{"asset_id": 1124, "start": 162.5, "end": 163.98, "text": "你不信咱们走着瞧"}
